# Assembly of the nonnormal two-component geometry

The shared module proves the conditional normalizer argument of 16.2.7,
the implication 16.2.8(1) → 16.2.8(3), and the residual noncontainment
argument of 16.2.9(2). It also supplies the actual conjugation and local-orbit
interfaces for the remaining proofs. Their construction and the strong-closure
argument of 16.2.10 remain to be assembled here.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
1 March 2004 manuscript, pp.1174–1176. No full numbered source theorem is
asserted by this intermediate assembly module.
